°．☆° ．" + BLINK HIY "★" NOR + HIC "·" + BLINK HIG "我也要追到你" NOR + HIC "  °．°°．" + BLINK HIY "★
" NOR + HIC "．" + HIW "☆" + HIC "°．
．·°∴" + BLINK HIY "★" NOR + HIC "°．°∴°．" + HIW "☆" + HIC "° ．·°∴°．" + HIW "☆" + HIC "° ．·°
" + HIW "☆" + HIC "·°∴°★．°．∴·°°" + BLINK HIB "并永远爱你" NOR + HIC "∴" + HIW "☆" + HIC "°．·°
